From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 20:41:51 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] airoha: en751221: xz000-g3-v2: read the SPI-NOR in dual mode

DO and DI of the EN25QH32B go to the SoC, while WP# and HOLD# only have
pull-ups to VCC, so the flash can be read over two lines but not four.
Single-wire reads at 25 MHz verified identical to reads at 12.5 MHz
over the whole chip.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
---
 arch/mips/dts/econet,en751221-tplink_xz000-g3-v2.dts | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/mips/dts/econet,en751221-tplink_xz000-g3-v2.dts b/arch/mips/dts/econet,en751221-tplink_xz000-g3-v2.dts
index c21e9b98..8724244a 100644
--- a/arch/mips/dts/econet,en751221-tplink_xz000-g3-v2.dts
+++ b/arch/mips/dts/econet,en751221-tplink_xz000-g3-v2.dts
@@ -67,7 +67,7 @@
 		reg = <0>;
 		spi-max-frequency = <25000000>;
 		spi-tx-bus-width = <1>;
-		spi-rx-bus-width = <1>;
+		spi-rx-bus-width = <2>;
 
 		partitions {
 			compatible = "fixed-partitions";
-- 
